Added `diffsync.uid`, the single encode/decode entry point for unique ids. New uids use character escaping plus length-prefixed segments under a `v2¶` marker, eliminating collisions when model names or primary keys contain underscores; legacy `"__"`-joined uids still read back verbatim from the local store, Redis store and historical diffs. Ambiguous legacy uids and malformed uids are tracked through idempotent collision/degradation counters (replaying a record never double-counts).
